---

This project composes two independent upstream projects and modifies neither:

  KubeSwift            https://github.com/kubeswift-io/kubeswift        (AGPL-3.0)
  HAMi                 https://github.com/Project-HAMi/HAMi            (Apache-2.0)

KubeSwift resources (SwiftGuest, SwiftSeedProfile) are accessed exclusively
through the Kubernetes API using unstructured clients and hard-coded
GroupVersionKinds. No KubeSwift Go package is imported, and no KubeSwift code is
copied or linked into this project.
